@thesamparr Most people shouldn't be an entrepreneur yet you spend every waking hour pushing lifestyle content on the millionaires it created.

It's also not day trading. It's loading a couple of equities you believe in long term instead of diversifying. 

A huge chunk of your net worth was in HubSpot stock for a very long time, one single stock. You probably made way more than an index at least before the stock got crushed this year but I bet you were able to take profits out over time.
